// Use the shared block +queue without defining it in the diagram
architecture Hand jobs to a worker through a queue

box api as API [note: takes requests, icon: server]
+queue q as Job queue [note: keeps jobs in order]
box worker as Worker [note: runs jobs, icon: exe]

step Enqueue
  say The API puts the job in the queue and answers the request right away.
  api -> q: job

step Run
  say The worker takes the oldest job from the queue and runs it.
  q -> worker: next job
